omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ocSG0sCre4AQ7kNvwHQUZEC&_nc_oc=AdqNwNnuYU6PsjxPsOmOUlw6XH_u1U8aebd3DcN3-oXzv0iJ4W_4RwbTjt8_PJ_hA04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQER-0XtK8tY8T92ICTxsG46CrDC49v7EJjKRigXaI9unw&oe=6A8834F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=19bYKksAUTcQ7kNvwHLxCj3&_nc_oc=AdoqCyDhmNnTRTofh30bH45qXMlOZvs_mCZAdeuoF9L9oJhgcAk57f69zd16Sc65Wlw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH1TKOexm9D-SIxFGDpywb4Ed5oHIydWaIEq2BEjV0x4Q&oe=6A883656"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G1KrcMB-plwQ7kNvwGn7wSE&_nc_oc=AdouIyHM0m_ZmEylzKavMB9HVDKtY5eGLUbw7t1vVbUrqc-Q_H3WCtE6szHFiIoMRHA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHMYFtuHji2xuc6rkis4Co84FeLTvTsF5vGdYd1NQ3Hjw&oe=6A884B77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://